+/*
+ * Open implementation of the OAuth2 / OIDC login flow for the open-source build
+ * of Windmill (windmill-oss-unlock).
+ *
+ * Ported from the last fully open upstream implementation, windmill v1.250.0
+ * (backend/windmill-api/src/oauth2.rs and users.rs::login_externally), which is
+ * licensed under the AGPLv3 (Copyright: Windmill Labs, Inc 2022). Trimmed to the
+ * login flow: resource "connect" flows and token refresh stay unimplemented, so
+ * only the `logins` map of `AllClients` is populated.
+ *
+ * Every SQL statement here uses the runtime query builders on purpose: the nixpkgs
+ * build runs with SQLX_OFFLINE=true and the `sqlx::query!` macros would need
+ * entries in backend/.sqlx that upstream does not ship for this code.
+ */
